WEBVTT

00:00:23.959 --> 00:00:26.756
♪ When this moment come to us ♪

00:00:26.997 --> 00:00:29.366
♪ The Stars will always shine ♪
[Full-Time Magister 3]

00:00:29.781 --> 00:00:33.621
♪ The light travels through
the horizon to you ♪

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.993
♪ Right now light it up
follow your heart, yeah ♪

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:48.746
♪ Our dream of madness is rattling ♪

00:00:48.747 --> 00:00:50.742
♪ Just cause you feel it possible ♪

00:00:50.794 --> 00:00:55.288
♪ My eyes will open wide
in this cold, dark night ♪

00:00:55.869 --> 00:00:58.505
♪ The heart bound by time
is just a shackle ♪

00:00:58.506 --> 00:01:00.656
♪ You said that dreams will never fall ♪

00:01:00.657 --> 00:01:03.915
♪ You put on the wings for me ♪

00:01:03.945 --> 00:01:08.077
♪ Braving through the wind ♪

00:01:09.612 --> 00:01:12.396
♪ When this moment comes to us ♪

00:01:12.408 --> 00:01:14.708
♪ My heart will no longer be lost ♪

00:01:15.285 --> 00:01:19.422
♪ I carry the weight of stars
and moon as I search for you ♪

00:01:19.448 --> 00:01:21.848
♪ You summon me from the dream ♪

00:01:21.849 --> 00:01:24.897
♪ My ambition is burning on ♪

00:01:24.898 --> 00:01:27.521
♪ You are the hope of light
in my darkest night ♪

00:01:27.522 --> 00:01:29.116
♪ On the other end of shine ♪

00:01:29.117 --> 00:01:31.635
♪ Let it all out and fight ♪

00:01:31.636 --> 00:01:34.757
♪ Shine bright like
it's the end of the world ♪

00:01:34.835 --> 00:01:37.303
♪ The Stars is burning through the sky ♪

00:01:37.317 --> 00:01:39.187
♪ Your hands are now ♪

00:01:39.188 --> 00:01:40.721
♪ Burning ♪

00:01:41.069 --> 00:01:44.760
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:49.973
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:01:50.827 --> 00:01:53.441
♪ Fight against all odds
of our generation ♪

00:02:00.099 --> 00:02:00.724
Chancellor.

00:02:03.789 --> 00:02:06.097
We have the largest collection
in the country.

00:02:06.706 --> 00:02:08.920
There are many books
about Shadow Magic too.

00:02:10.711 --> 00:02:13.881
On the day of the assessment,
I knew you're hiding something.

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:18.168
Although I didn't see how did you
escape from the Forest Prison,

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:20.671
I smelt the Scent of Darkness.

00:02:22.394 --> 00:02:24.501
There are some information
that I can't disclose.

00:02:25.239 --> 00:02:27.719
I will not ask if you aren't willing
to disclose that information.

00:02:28.119 --> 00:02:31.199
But, one day you'll reveal it yourself.

00:02:31.662 --> 00:02:34.873
Enough, let's talk about
the main issue now.

00:02:34.967 --> 00:02:37.143
I have been waiting for you to say that.

00:02:37.667 --> 00:02:41.459
The public resources are originally
divided into parts for all the students.

00:02:41.923 --> 00:02:42.909
The academy decided to...

00:02:42.949 --> 00:02:46.067
convert the public resources
to resources that you can use.

00:02:46.625 --> 00:02:48.652
As long as I can get
the resources in full.

00:02:50.527 --> 00:02:51.981
You little devil.

00:02:53.388 --> 00:02:55.361
These are a few high quality
magic weapons.

00:02:55.875 --> 00:02:58.008
Level 2 mages can use them in battle.

00:02:58.820 --> 00:03:00.420
Each and every piece
is worth a lot, right?

00:03:01.174 --> 00:03:02.100
Choose the one that you like.

00:03:02.735 --> 00:03:04.162
Your training resources,

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:07.168
Summoning Beast resources
and scholarship will be given later.

00:03:12.002 --> 00:03:14.548
This one beside you is
the Boots of the Beast.

00:03:14.868 --> 00:03:17.782
It was refined from Changbai Mountain's
Bloodthirsty Beast's flesh and blood.

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:22.333
If you wear them, you'll get the
Bloodthirsty Beast's running ability.

00:03:22.651 --> 00:03:25.051
Your legs will also be able to
cut through hills and break rocks.

00:03:25.489 --> 00:03:28.037
I can take the initiative
to attack? Great.

00:03:29.091 --> 00:03:31.311
What about this?
It looks like an Armour.

00:03:33.452 --> 00:03:36.212
Yes, it's a Magic Armour.

00:03:38.078 --> 00:03:39.713
Its name is Qinglin Armour,

00:03:39.979 --> 00:03:42.464
whose biggest feature
is flexible and soft.

00:03:42.984 --> 00:03:44.679
But, it's weak in defense.

00:03:46.492 --> 00:03:49.165
This Magic Armour should be
the weakest weapon here.

00:03:51.448 --> 00:03:55.288
But, it can ward off
the Slave Level monsters.

00:03:57.749 --> 00:04:01.107
Here, see if you're interested in
this Magic Sword.

00:04:01.463 --> 00:04:02.569
Its name is Black Sword.

00:04:02.823 --> 00:04:06.330
After activating it, it'll turn into
a Black Raptor's front arm.

00:04:06.626 --> 00:04:10.377
It's as powerful as
two Intermediate Level monsters.

00:04:11.208 --> 00:04:12.419
-And this one...
-Chancellor.

00:04:12.526 --> 00:04:13.534
I've decided.

00:04:14.905 --> 00:04:16.408
I'll take the Boots of the Beast.

00:04:19.018 --> 00:04:21.165
The Shadow Magic
doesn't make you invisible.

00:04:21.364 --> 00:04:24.578
It can't move around freely like
Wind Magic and Earth Magic.

00:04:25.521 --> 00:04:28.001
Boots of the Beast will help you a lot.

00:04:28.649 --> 00:04:29.609
Try them out.

00:04:42.938 --> 00:04:46.698
You will have one chance to
enter the Three Step Pagoda to train.

00:04:47.043 --> 00:04:48.163
Three Step Pagoda?

00:04:49.793 --> 00:04:52.566
Mingzhu Academy was
able to stay at the top...

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:54.656
largely because of Three Step Pagoda.

00:04:55.199 --> 00:04:57.279
It's a sacred training ground...

00:04:57.532 --> 00:05:00.440
and can assist you
in increasing your power.

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:02.937
So, this is a rare chance.

00:05:04.204 --> 00:05:05.217
Thank you, chancellor.

00:05:05.897 --> 00:05:07.616
You earned it by your hard work.

00:05:07.732 --> 00:05:09.078
No need to thank me.

00:05:09.492 --> 00:05:11.446
But, I have a suggestion for you.

00:05:12.007 --> 00:05:13.513
As it is a rare chance,

00:05:13.607 --> 00:05:16.295
you should choose a suitable time
for yourself to enter the pagoda.

00:05:16.828 --> 00:05:18.580
From what I've observed,

00:05:18.727 --> 00:05:22.001
you will only gain minimum benefits
if you enter the pagoda now.

00:05:22.765 --> 00:05:24.210
Okay, I got it.

00:05:25.263 --> 00:05:28.263
There's 2 million yuan in this card.

00:05:28.292 --> 00:05:31.584
The public scholarship for
all faculties belongs to you now.

00:05:31.937 --> 00:05:35.483
For mages, money is an aid.

00:05:35.751 --> 00:05:39.293
Most importantly, pursue higher
achievements in the path of magic.

00:05:39.796 --> 00:05:42.316
You should understand
what is the responsibility...

00:05:42.337 --> 00:05:43.751
of a real mage...

00:05:44.399 --> 00:05:47.012
and the current situation of humans now.

00:05:47.145 --> 00:05:49.007
-It's a life-long path.
-Don't worry.

00:05:49.034 --> 00:05:51.269
I will not be satisfied with just being
a Level 2 mage.

00:05:53.027 --> 00:05:55.547
I hope that if a bigger
disaster arrives,

00:05:55.974 --> 00:05:58.789
you can lend a hand like
what you did in Bow City.

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:01.787
I'll remember your advice, chancellor.

00:06:06.375 --> 00:06:08.959
The Fuchsia Fire costs more
than 20 million yuan now.

00:06:09.209 --> 00:06:11.526
That means the Lightning Seed
must cost more.

00:06:11.918 --> 00:06:13.038
For the Winged Magic Tool...

00:06:13.235 --> 00:06:14.808
Don't even think about that.

00:06:16.464 --> 00:06:18.424
The 2 million scholarship isn't enough.

00:06:24.413 --> 00:06:26.150
Dad, I transferred some money to you.

00:06:26.501 --> 00:06:28.002
Find a house in the city.

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:30.733
By the way, Xinxia has
difficulty moving around.

00:06:30.786 --> 00:06:32.120
She's alone in Song City.

00:06:32.272 --> 00:06:33.639
I want to hire a nanny for her.

00:06:35.175 --> 00:06:36.642
I got a scholarship from the academy.

00:06:36.776 --> 00:06:38.249
Don't worry,
I have enough money.

00:06:48.145 --> 00:06:49.977
Mr. Fan Mo. After consulting,

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:52.067
to be a City Hunter in Mingzhu City,

00:06:52.068 --> 00:06:53.856
you have to be an Elite Hunter.

00:06:54.834 --> 00:06:57.710
Your previous experience wasn't enough.

00:06:59.177 --> 00:07:00.643
The competition is that fierce?

00:07:01.506 --> 00:07:03.933
How do I become an Elite Hunter?

00:07:05.568 --> 00:07:07.914
You will have to complete tasks...

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:09.873
to gain more contribution points.

00:07:10.578 --> 00:07:11.844
According to your data,

00:07:11.883 --> 00:07:13.382
you're only a Level 2 hunter.

00:07:13.539 --> 00:07:16.006
That means you're a Novice Hunter.

00:07:18.276 --> 00:07:20.636
I'm capable enough to accept
higher level assignments.

00:07:21.887 --> 00:07:24.953
But, the Hunters' League has to
be responsible to our clients.

00:07:25.054 --> 00:07:27.094
We can't hire unqualified hunters.

00:07:29.244 --> 00:07:30.950
You're a professional
Hunter's Assistant.

00:07:31.004 --> 00:07:32.222
Can't you think of another way?

00:07:33.149 --> 00:07:35.191
Refund my money. Quick!

00:07:38.089 --> 00:07:39.149
If that's the case,

00:07:39.150 --> 00:07:40.622
you can consider...

00:07:40.645 --> 00:07:42.498
joining a private hunter club.

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:47.218
-Private hunter club?
-They are founded by Master Hunters.

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:50.536
They will use their own reputation
to attract clients.

00:07:51.219 --> 00:07:52.286
They will set higher prices.

00:07:53.183 --> 00:07:55.583
They also have a high success rate
of completion and efficiency.

00:07:56.155 --> 00:07:57.795
Great, I'll do just that.

00:08:00.657 --> 00:08:04.043
Mr. Fan Mo, this private hunter club
has been established a long time ago.

00:08:04.084 --> 00:08:05.057
They have a good reputation.

00:08:05.884 --> 00:08:09.752
But, I don't know why many hunters
resigned after working for a few days.

00:08:10.203 --> 00:08:12.029
Maybe their superior were hard on them.

00:08:14.481 --> 00:08:17.358
This is their address.
You can go there for an interview.

00:08:24.864 --> 00:08:26.224
What a grand name.

00:08:31.102 --> 00:08:32.902
The price will depend on
how difficult the task is.

00:08:32.916 --> 00:08:34.102
Starting price is 300,000 yuan.

00:08:35.947 --> 00:08:37.200
I'm here for an interview.

00:08:38.932 --> 00:08:40.425
You want to be a hunter?

00:08:40.815 --> 00:08:41.975
Aren't you too young?

00:08:43.002 --> 00:08:45.017
I'm young? Little girl,

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:46.816
you're about 12 years old, right?

00:08:47.836 --> 00:08:49.991
Ling Ling, is there a client?

00:08:51.555 --> 00:08:53.400
Grandpa, he's here for an interview.

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:55.259
He's too young. We won't hire him.

00:08:57.992 --> 00:08:59.024
Little girl.

00:09:00.321 --> 00:09:01.547
Grandpa, we have a potential client!

00:09:03.439 --> 00:09:04.439
Who is it?

00:09:04.626 --> 00:09:05.695
She looks nervous.

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:07.353
From her appearance,

00:09:07.421 --> 00:09:09.034
she looks like a rich lady.

00:09:09.089 --> 00:09:11.681
This hunter club looks like
a shop filled with murderers.

00:09:16.346 --> 00:09:17.759
Welcome!

00:09:22.245 --> 00:09:23.259
Since I'm here,

00:09:23.324 --> 00:09:24.590
I'll just go in.

00:09:41.971 --> 00:09:44.606
You mean, your husband may be a monster?

00:09:44.607 --> 00:09:46.706
He goes out at night to kill people?

00:09:47.516 --> 00:09:49.143
I didn't believe it at first.

00:09:49.216 --> 00:09:51.869
This morning, I washed
my husband's clothes.

00:09:51.976 --> 00:09:54.468
His clothes was splattered with blood.

00:09:54.887 --> 00:09:56.434
I'm terrified.

00:09:57.887 --> 00:10:00.007
If your husband were really a monster,

00:10:00.482 --> 00:10:02.642
you wouldn't come to us alive.

00:10:05.139 --> 00:10:06.605
I don't know.

00:10:06.974 --> 00:10:09.755
He looks normal in the day.

00:10:10.142 --> 00:10:12.437
Sir, help me!

00:10:12.438 --> 00:10:14.142
And my child too.

00:10:16.409 --> 00:10:17.889
You should file a police report.

00:10:19.259 --> 00:10:21.888
The police won't look into this matter.

00:10:21.943 --> 00:10:25.570
You don't have enough evidence that your
husband has turned into a monster.

00:10:25.752 --> 00:10:27.312
Think positively.

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:29.470
Your husband may not be a monster,

00:10:29.643 --> 00:10:31.470
he may be a normal murderer.

00:10:31.661 --> 00:10:34.004
Normal what?

00:10:34.350 --> 00:10:35.782
Please, help me.

00:10:35.783 --> 00:10:37.671
I can pay you immediately.

00:10:44.051 --> 00:10:45.064
I'm sorry.

00:10:45.117 --> 00:10:46.414
We can't help you.

00:10:47.718 --> 00:10:50.105
How could you turn me away?

00:10:55.425 --> 00:10:56.265
If...

00:10:56.345 --> 00:10:58.233
If something happens to my family,

00:10:58.540 --> 00:11:00.448
I won't let you go easily!

00:11:03.982 --> 00:11:05.382
Why didn't you help her?

00:11:09.746 --> 00:11:10.732
Young man,

00:11:10.866 --> 00:11:13.008
you can’t just look at the surface.

00:11:13.491 --> 00:11:15.398
Are there any ulterior motives?

00:11:16.144 --> 00:11:17.197
Take a look at this.

00:11:19.930 --> 00:11:22.214
[Security Service Contract between
Qing Tian Hunter Club and Zhang Depeng]

00:11:22.295 --> 00:11:24.631
There is a similar situation
in this family.

00:11:25.945 --> 00:11:27.412
Look at the address.

00:11:27.957 --> 00:11:30.157
It's the same address mentioned
by the woman.

00:11:30.667 --> 00:11:31.569
What is going on?

00:11:33.492 --> 00:11:36.732
The woman's husband
signed this contract with us.

00:11:37.025 --> 00:11:38.357
But, according to what he said,

00:11:38.371 --> 00:11:41.429
the midnight murderer
was that woman instead.

00:11:42.397 --> 00:11:45.474
You're making me get goosebumps.

00:11:46.382 --> 00:11:47.428
Young man,

00:11:47.591 --> 00:11:49.911
you'll be assigned to this task.

00:11:52.187 --> 00:11:53.494
You've decided to hire me?

00:11:53.748 --> 00:11:55.454
What's wrong?
Are you afraid?

00:11:56.010 --> 00:11:58.130
No. But...

00:11:58.170 --> 00:12:00.595
I don't know who spoke the truth.

00:12:02.271 --> 00:12:03.817
Don't bother about the truth.

00:12:03.991 --> 00:12:07.084
The clients wants us
to protect their child.

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:09.165
Okay. Then...

00:12:09.274 --> 00:12:11.389
-Will I have a partner?
-Yes.

00:12:19.725 --> 00:12:21.392
I'm bringing this little girl
to hunt monsters?

00:12:21.472 --> 00:12:22.538
Are you joking?

00:12:24.435 --> 00:12:25.395
Take a good look at this.
[Master Hunter]

00:12:25.541 --> 00:12:27.444
I'm bringing you, a Novice Hunter
to hunt monsters.

00:12:28.498 --> 00:12:30.751
[Master Hunter]

00:12:30.973 --> 00:12:33.105
Master Hunter?

00:12:34.695 --> 00:12:36.248
Grandpa, I don't want
to be partners with him.

00:12:36.313 --> 00:12:37.873
He looks like a fool.

00:12:39.110 --> 00:12:40.443
It's hard to recruit hunters.

00:12:40.479 --> 00:12:42.622
It's rare to see someone fearless.

00:12:42.917 --> 00:12:44.063
We'll take him.

00:12:44.366 --> 00:12:45.579
It's late.

00:12:45.793 --> 00:12:47.460
Fan Mo, stay for dinner.

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:53.452
Master...

00:12:58.252 --> 00:12:59.306
Fan Mo,

00:12:59.492 --> 00:13:01.145
you're still a student.

00:13:01.305 --> 00:13:03.652
Why do you want to be a hunter?

00:13:06.497 --> 00:13:07.444
According to my chancellor,

00:13:07.617 --> 00:13:08.972
we can't keep on training.

00:13:09.208 --> 00:13:10.555
We have to practise in real battles.

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:13.633
We have to face danger
like real hunters...

00:13:13.937 --> 00:13:15.444
to become stronger.

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:17.880
Earning money in dangerous situations.

00:13:18.175 --> 00:13:19.775
That is what you're thinking about.

00:13:21.692 --> 00:13:22.710
Yes.

00:13:23.292 --> 00:13:26.159
My granddaughter is
more matured than others.

00:13:26.186 --> 00:13:27.380
Hence, she's a little arrogant.

00:13:27.513 --> 00:13:29.334
If she offends you,
don't take it to heart.

00:13:34.635 --> 00:13:36.968
This small case is worth
a few hundred thousand yuan.

00:13:37.021 --> 00:13:38.515
Treat it as a practice.

00:13:38.755 --> 00:13:39.974
A few hundred thousand?

00:13:40.134 --> 00:13:41.370
This is a small case?

00:13:42.644 --> 00:13:44.070
I forgot to introduce myself.

00:13:44.243 --> 00:13:47.037
I'm the president of Qing Tian
Hunter Club, my surname is Bao.

00:13:47.323 --> 00:13:49.323
Just call me Old Bao.

00:13:49.779 --> 00:13:52.064
Bao? Someone who investigates too?

00:13:53.073 --> 00:13:55.155
Are you related to Justice Bao?

00:14:01.341 --> 00:14:02.057
This...

00:14:02.354 --> 00:14:03.541
isn't funny?

00:14:08.585 --> 00:14:10.945
Grandpa, why did you recruit him?

00:14:11.907 --> 00:14:13.681
He has potential.

00:14:13.916 --> 00:14:16.236
I believe he will surprise you.

00:14:16.681 --> 00:14:19.741
Grandpa, his resume stated
that he's from Bow City.

00:14:20.383 --> 00:14:24.407
Yes. Lengqing is helping
the Holy Court to trace Salang.

00:14:24.820 --> 00:14:28.561
Most probably, Salang is the one
responsible for Bow City’s destruction.

00:14:29.775 --> 00:14:31.850
Don't tell Fan Mo about this.

00:14:32.037 --> 00:14:33.308
With his current strength,

00:14:33.453 --> 00:14:35.493
he can't be involved in this.

00:14:42.757 --> 00:14:43.570
Fan Mo,

00:14:44.089 --> 00:14:46.199
let's meet at the designated spot
at 7 o'clock tonight.

00:14:47.304 --> 00:14:49.643
[Taxi]

00:14:53.394 --> 00:14:55.411
Sir, please go to
Masterpiece Private Garden.

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:01.052
Why don't you carpool?

00:15:01.105 --> 00:15:02.822
They are heading there too.

00:15:03.809 --> 00:15:06.091
Of course, I won't chase
pretty girls out of the taxi.

00:15:06.688 --> 00:15:07.742
During the Battle of the Beasts,

00:15:07.815 --> 00:15:09.271
you embarrassed Bai Cangfeng.

00:15:09.584 --> 00:15:11.744
We're being polite
by not chasing you out.

00:15:15.475 --> 00:15:17.515
Sir, let's go.

00:15:37.939 --> 00:15:39.044
Little girl, don't sit there.

00:15:39.493 --> 00:15:40.094
It's dangerous.

00:15:40.762 --> 00:15:41.749
Why are you late?

00:15:42.722 --> 00:15:44.190
What did you discover?

00:15:44.628 --> 00:15:45.394
See it yourself.

00:15:48.662 --> 00:15:51.635
When did you install
CCTVs in their house?

00:15:53.262 --> 00:15:54.622
Something will happen soon.

00:16:01.022 --> 00:16:02.369
How many monsters are there...

00:16:02.435 --> 00:16:03.875
in this beautiful city?

00:16:06.655 --> 00:16:07.962
At least there's one here.

00:16:09.193 --> 00:16:10.166
I'm going to take a bath.

00:16:10.640 --> 00:16:12.706
Ling Ling, you must be
tired from observing.

00:16:13.209 --> 00:16:15.132
-I'll do it.
-Go away.

00:16:15.462 --> 00:16:17.488
Do you think I'm a three-year-old kid?
Pervert!

00:16:21.914 --> 00:16:24.889
Fan Mo, do you remember
this woman said...

00:16:25.016 --> 00:16:28.034
